<title>USA: Diabetic Medserv sets two-for-one split.</title>
<headline>Diabetic Medserv sets two-for-one split.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH MIAMI BEACH, Fla. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diabetic Medserv Inc said it declared a two-for-one stock split, payable November 27, record November 20.</p>
</text>
